# Gradual R8 optimization repackages some Kotlin subclasses while leaving their
# package-private parents behind (StringsKt__StringBuilderKt/StringsKt__IndentKt),
# causing IllegalAccessError during WorkManager startup. Preserve package access
# while still allowing class/member shrinking, renaming, and optimization.
-keeppackagenames kotlin.**
